@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### GET JWT token
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "root",
    "password": "root"
}

### GET forecast
GET {{baseUrl}}/weather/forecast/?location=Tokyo&date=2026-06-01&date_range_after=2026-06-06 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

